      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Needing fifteen thousand rubles to pay Ilya for Sasha's earrings, Max asks everyone in the kitchen for a loan. One by one, the cooks demonstrate the classic stages of dodging a loan request, leaving only Ilya himself offering to lend the money.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
